      "body": "<!-- proofline:finding-series=01a1fe5b-2736-72ea-ba48-4f5d3a66f521 -->\n**Warning** \u00b7 History skips deliveries with the same scheduled time across pages\n\nHistory sorts by `scheduled_at` and `id`, but the cursor keeps only `scheduled_at` and the next page requires a strictly earlier time.\n\nWhen a page ends mid-tie, the remaining deliveries at that time never appear in subsequent pages.\n\nEncode both `scheduled_at` and `id` in the cursor and resume with a strict comparison on that pair.\n\n[View finding in Proofline](https://proofline.sh/orgs/by-id/01a1fe4f-49f1-7732-81cb-f1d6ad806605/reviews/01a1fe5a-98f7-756e-b5dc-3582105f5107/findings/01a1fe5b-273c-7360-afef-69635970c203)",
